			"notes": "First release. Client-only mod for Minecraft 26.2 and 26.1.2.\n\n- Periodically sends a configurable chat message so your friends know you're AFK.\n- Configure via `/afkspam` (on/off/toggle/status/message/interval) or the in-game config screen.\n- Fabric, NeoForge, and Forge builds, for both Minecraft 26.2 and 26.1.2. Quilt is not currently\n  supported: Quilt Loader and Quilted Fabric API have no build for either Minecraft version yet.\n\nDownload the jar matching your Minecraft version and loader:\n\n- `afk-chat-spammer-fabric-26.2-*.jar` / `afk-chat-spammer-neoforge-26.2-*.jar` / `afk-chat-spammer-forge-26.2-*.jar` — Minecraft 26.2\n- `afk-chat-spammer-fabric-26.1-*.jar` / `afk-chat-spammer-neoforge-26.1-*.jar` / `afk-chat-spammer-forge-26.1-*.jar` — Minecraft 26.1.2\n\nFabric and NeoForge builds need [Cloth Config](https://modrinth.com/mod/cloth-config) for the\nconfig screen (Fabric also needs [Fabric API](https://modrinth.com/mod/fabric-api) and optionally\n[Mod Menu](https://modrinth.com/mod/modmenu)). The Forge build has its own built-in config screen\nand needs no extra dependency for it.\n\nSee the [wiki](https://github.com/the-real-ltcg/afk-chat-spammer/wiki) for installation and usage."
		}
